    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82368" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιτίλλω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pluck all round, strip</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θρίδακα</span>
			<i>strip the outside leaves off</i> a lettuce, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.32
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θρίδαξ περιτετιλμένη</span>
			ibid.: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιτετιλμένος τὰ πτερά</span>
			<i>having one's</i> feathers <i>all plucked off</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Gall.</u>
				23
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>pluck out</i>, 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρατίλλω</span>
			.</div>
